{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105278","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105278/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105278/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105278/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105278","id":2988618603,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SQc9u","number":105278,"title":"Smoke test: Log an error if `reserve()` is called with fewer elements than `size()`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-11T13:01:31Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T18:00:39Z","closed_at":"2025-04-23T17:11:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105278","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105278.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105278.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-23T17:11:45Z"},"body":"Follow-up to @AThousandShips' and my conversation at https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103698#issuecomment-2721117519\r\n\r\nCurrently, some core collections (`OAHashMap`, `AStar2D`, `AStar3D`, and `AHashMap`) log an error if `new_capacity < old_capacity`.\r\nAt first glance, this makes sense because you want to catch bugs in `reserve()` calling behavior.\r\nHowever, the logic is flawed, because the following will also print an error:\r\n```c++\r\nmap.reserve(10);\r\nmap.reserve(11);\r\n// Error: It is impossible to reserve less capacity than is currently available.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is because `reserve` doesn't reserve exactly the number of requested elements (for almost all collections), but rather to the next largest power of 2. This fact is not exposed to the caller. This can be confusing, and leads to callers always having to run explicit checks to avoid error messages:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nif (map.capacity() < needed_capacity) {\r\n\tmap.reserve(needed_capacity)\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere is a good alternative: Checking for `size() < capacity` instead. This should catch the same mistake that was intended with the current check, without being misleading or accidentally exposing reserve mechanics. I don't think there is a situation where calling `reserve` is realistically correct with a number smaller than the current size.\r\n\r\nFor example, this smoke test finds the following bug:\r\n```c++\r\nvoid add_elements(LocalVector<Vector3> r_points) {\r\n\tr_points.reserve(3);\r\n\t// Should have been r_points.reserve(r_points.size() + 3);\r\n\tr_points.push_back(Vector3(1, 2, 3));\r\n\tr_points.push_back(Vector3(1, 2, 3));\r\n\tr_points.push_back(Vector3(1, 2, 3));\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe suggested smoke test is added to all collections that support `reserve()`.\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/12285.*\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102612","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105278/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105278/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}